--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The raw datasets are not redistributed in this repository. UCI-HAR, mHealth,
and KU-HAR are downloaded from their public sources by
scripts/download_data.sh. The fixed Dirichlet client partitions generated
from those datasets are included under partitions/ so that the reported
splits can be reproduced exactly. Users are responsible for complying with
the terms of use of each dataset.
